# perch configuration — copy to .env and edit:
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# .env is gitignored. It is auto-loaded on `go run .` and read by
# `docker compose` too. Anything already set in the real environment wins.

# --- Authentication -------------------------------------------------------
# The shared login key. Leave empty to run OPEN (fine locally, NOT on a VPS).
# This name is used by both the compose stack and `go run .`.
PERCH_KEY=

# Optional: "Sign in with GitHub" as an alternative to the key. Create a GitHub
# OAuth App (Settings -> Developer settings -> OAuth Apps) and set its
# Authorization callback URL to:
#   https://<your-domain>/api/auth/github/callback
#   (or http://localhost:3535/api/auth/github/callback for local testing)
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Comma-separated GitHub usernames allowed to sign in, e.g. octocat,alice
GITHUB_ALLOWED_USERS=
# Comma-separated VERIFIED GitHub emails allowed to sign in (optional)
GITHUB_ALLOWED_EMAILS=

# --- Rate limiting (only active when auth is on) --------------------------
# RATE_LIMIT=50
# RATE_WINDOW_SECONDS=10
# BAN_HOURS=10

# --- Health checks --------------------------------------------------------
# `go run .` finds ./checks.yml automatically; override the path if needed.
# CHECKS_FILE=checks.yml

# --- nginx proxy manager "Requests" tile ----------------------------------
# Mount NPM's log dir into the container and point this at it.
# NPM_LOG_DIR=/npm-logs

# --- Alerting / notifications ---------------------------------------------
# A webhook that gets a message when a check goes DOWN, a container turns
# unhealthy, or a disk fills up. Empty = alerts off. Supported targets:
#   Discord / Slack : paste the incoming-webhook URL as-is ({content,text} body)
#   Telegram        : https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/sendMessage?chat_id=<ID>
#                     (token from @BotFather, chat id from @userinfobot)
# You can ALSO set/change this live in the UI (Notifications card, "save") —
# a saved URL overrides this env value and persists across restarts.
# ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL=
# ALERT_DISK_PCT=90          # disk-full alert threshold (percent)

# --- API usage / cost tab -------------------------------------------------
# Org-level ADMIN keys (sk-admin-... / sk-ant-admin...), read SERVER-SIDE only
# and never sent to the browser. Treat as root secrets. Empty = tab off.
# OPENAI_ADMIN_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_ADMIN_KEY=
